"}, {"id": 1755314, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11meq.jpg"}, {"id": 1755311, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11men.jpg"}, {"id": 1755307, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11mej.jpg"}, {"id": 1755312, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11meo.jpg"}], "slug": "kiipluu", "storyline": "Hunted across a savage Neolithic world by the cannibalistic Na\u2019ush, Kiipluu must survive using stealth, wit, and nerve. Every shadow is a hiding place. Every mistake could be his last. As danger closes in and spirits haunt his path, will he reach home\u2026 or be broken by the journey?", "summary": "Kiipluu is a hardcore stealth adventure set in a brutal Neolithic world.\n\nEvery encounter is a tense survival puzzle. Study patrol routes, use tall grass, shadows, sound, and terrain to stay hidden. Set traps, strike from ambush, or slip past unseen. Being discovered can quickly become fatal.\n\nWhen stealth fails, combat is fast, brutal, and unforgiving. Weapons are primitive. Injuries matter. There are no easy victories.\n\nAlong the way, Kiipluu is haunted by dreamlike spirit journeys and visions of his father, a legendary hunter whose shadow looms over every choice. Your decisions shape who survives, who is lost, and what kind of person Kiipluu becomes.\n\nThis is a story of fear, survival, and growing up in a world that wants you dead.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kiipluu", "videos": [{"id": 158766, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "dyuHwrvBg_Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dyuHwrvBg_Y", "title": "Kiipluu gameplay video 2", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dyuHwrvBg_Y/sddefault.jpg"}]}